  "prefLabel": "He-W 512.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-06-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 512.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to describe the alternative benefit plan (ABP) services and the premium assistance program (PAP) available through the medicaid program to the newly eligible population in accordance with the New Hampshire Health Protection Program, RSA 126-A:5, XXIV.\n\nSource. #10656, eff 8-15-14; ss by #11012, INTERIM, eff 1-1-16, EXPIRES: 6-29-16; ss by #11119, eff 6-29-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
